flowchart LR
  A[Receive encounter, vitals, labs, medications] --> B[Validate source, schema, freshness, consent scope]
  B --> C[Profile dataset and derive approved features]
  C --> D[Run versioned local risk model]
  D --> E{Policy and quality gates pass?}
  E -- no --> F[Suppress alert, record reason, notify operations]
  E -- yes --> G[Present risk, contributing inputs, uncertainty, model version]
  G --> H[Clinician reviews and chooses action]
  H --> I[Store local outcome and audit trace]
  I --> J[Publish de-identified metrics and artifact pointers to GMA]

  classDef local fill:#DDE9F2,stroke:#356A8A,color:#15201B,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef gate fill:#E8E0F5,stroke:#7355A3,color:#15201B,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef outcome fill:#DCEADF,stroke:#2B6D4F,color:#15201B,stroke-width:2px;
  class A,B,C,D local;
  class E,F gate;
  class G,H,I,J outcome;
